          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 140,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "Deliver me, LORD, from evil men. Preserve me from violent men:",
      "ko": "여호와여 악인에게서 나를 건지시며 강포한 자에게서 나를 보전하소서",
      "source_text_hash": "13833de286eb9e66f94a71b731b18a643c0b8a6f18df77999917cc2e989d502b",
      "translation_text_hash": "b7aee44e42fb5d2f9aa7dd9e42aae131b761a81f1a25efcb3bb3934ed6631f93",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와여 악인에게서 나를 건지시며 강포한 자에게서 나를 보전하소서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b7aee44e42fb5d2f9aa7dd9e42aae131b761a81f1a25efcb3bb3934ed6631f93"
      ]
    },
